			<snippet></snippet>
			<description><![CDATA[<center><table><tr><th colspan='2' align='center'><em>Attributes</em></th></tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>MNHP_ID</th>
<td>MNHPS2-ACT-001</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>Location</th>
<td>Fadden</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>Grantee</th>
<td>Optus</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>State</th>
<td>ACT</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>Electorate (2022)</th>
<td>Bean</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>Local Government Area</th>
<td>Unincorporated ACT</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>Upgrade Type</th>
<td>Site Hardening</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>Description</th>
<td>A range of hardening measures targeting sites identified by a CSIRO bushfire threat analysis. Specific measures at each site are based on the outputs of a detailed site survey tool and include protective ember screening, cable tray protectors, roof protection, radiation barriers, etc.</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>Site Status</th>
<td>Complete</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>Date Complete</th>
<td>20231013</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
