<td>Portable generator setup deployed at a local Telstra depot that can be quickly deployed within a 150km radius. Telstra has spaced the generators across the country to provide an appropriate degree of overlap. Each generator setup can provide a minimum of 24 hours capacity between refuelling. The deployment include one 25kVA trailer mounted generator to support a mobile base station and two 3.2kVA portable generators to support backhaul sites.</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>Site Status</th>
<td>Complete</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>Date Complete</th>
<td>20230929</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
