<td>Bass Coast, Cardinia, South Gippsland, Wellington</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>Upgrade Type</th>
<td>Transmission diversity for a cluster of sites</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>Description</th>
<td>Adding additional backhaul to promote greater transmission redundancy at 35 key sites in a cluster.
The cluster sites are located in Alberton, Anderson, Arawata, Bena, Boorool, Cape Paterson, Coronet Bay, Dalyston, Foster, Foster North, Grantville, Inverloch, Kardella, Koo Wee Rup, Koonwarra, Korumburra, Lang Lang, Leongatha, Leongatha South, Loch, Middle Tarwin, Port Welshpool, Ryanston, Toora, Venus Bay, Welshpool, Wilsons Promontory, Wonthaggi, Woodside and Yarram.</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>Site Status</th>
<td>Complete</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>Date Complete</th>
<td>20230330</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
