</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>Local Government Area</th>
<td>Kangaroo Island, Yankalilla</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>Upgrade Type</th>
<td>Transmission diversity for a cluster of sites</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>Description</th>
<td>Adding additional backhaul to promote greater transmission redundancy at 10 key sites in a cluster.
The cluster sites are located in Ballast Head, Cygnet River, Dudley East, Kingscote, Macgillivray, Normanville, Parndana, Silverton, and Vivonne Bay.</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>Site Status</th>
<td>Complete</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>Date Complete</th>
<td>20220930</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
